# Operational config -- NO SECRETS. Copy to .env.config and edit freely.
#
# Unlike .env.example, config.py's Settings class does NOT read this file
# itself (or .env) via pydantic's own dotenv loading -- this service reads
# real process env vars only (see tests/test_onboarding_config.py). Locally,
# load it the same way .claude/skills/ui-visual-review/dev_stack.sh already
# loads .env: `uv run --env-file .env.config --env-file .env uvicorn ...`.
# On Render, set the var directly on the service instead of via a file.
#
# This file exists purely so a non-secret, demo-only override has somewhere
# documented to live, mirroring the sibling review-engine project's
# .env.config.example convention -- there is currently exactly one entry.

# --- Demo wizard ---
# Where the demo's "Finish & Deploy" step sends the reader. Only needed if
# you've deployed your own fork's demo bot under a different hostname than
# this project's own live demo.
# DEMO_BOT_URL=https://demo-pr-review-bot.onrender.com
